    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;O \u00daltimo dos Moicanos&quot;</strong> is a Tower Defense game with a touch of action and strategy, set in a post-apocalyptic future where the only thing left on Earth is a simple \u2014 yet resilient \u2014 farm owned by a lone archer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651360/extras/55204ab46cb4804cd7250ce011038ee9.poster.avif?t=1754625924\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651360/extras/55204ab46cb4804cd7250ce011038ee9.webm?t=1754625924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651360/extras/55204ab46cb4804cd7250ce011038ee9.mp4?t=1754625924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a devastating invasion by beings from other planets, what remained of human civilization was reduced to dust. Except for one thing: the farm of the last archer farmer. Determined to protect his land until the end, he becomes humanity\u2019s final hope.<br>But the aliens know this. They know that this farm is the last barrier standing in the way of total planetary domination. And they\u2019ll do everything they can to destroy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of this heroic farmer, facing waves of alien enemies across 10 challenging levels. With each stage, your chance of victory drops, making the journey even more tense and strategic:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 1: 90% chance of victory<br>Level 2: 80%<br>...<br>Level 10: Only a 5% chance of success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651360/extras/8e0709037935e797ed1a2f0ea842a560.avif?t=1754625924\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there\u2019s more: if you lose at any stage, you go back to the beginning. With each attempt, the pressure builds and your skill is pushed to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you defend the last living land on the planet?<br>Or will you let them take it all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;O \u00daltimo dos Moicanos&quot;</strong> is a Tower Defense game with a touch of action and strategy, set in a post-apocalyptic future where the only thing left on Earth is a simple \u2014 yet resilient \u2014 farm owned by a lone archer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651360/extras/55204ab46cb4804cd7250ce011038ee9.poster.avif?t=1754625924\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651360/extras/55204ab46cb4804cd7250ce011038ee9.webm?t=1754625924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651360/extras/55204ab46cb4804cd7250ce011038ee9.mp4?t=1754625924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a devastating invasion by beings from other planets, what remained of human civilization was reduced to dust. Except for one thing: the farm of the last archer farmer. Determined to protect his land until the end, he becomes humanity\u2019s final hope.<br>But the aliens know this. They know that this farm is the last barrier standing in the way of total planetary domination. And they\u2019ll do everything they can to destroy it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You take on the role of this heroic farmer, facing waves of alien enemies across 10 challenging levels. With each stage, your chance of victory drops, making the journey even more tense and strategic:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level 1: 90% chance of victory<br>Level 2: 80%<br>...<br>Level 10: Only a 5% chance of success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3651360/extras/8e0709037935e797ed1a2f0ea842a560.avif?t=1754625924\" data-has-big width=800 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And there\u2019s more: if you lose at any stage, you go back to the beginning. With each attempt, the pressure builds and your skill is pushed to the limit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you defend the last living land on the planet?<br>Or will you let them take it all?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
